      `Knowledge graph: ${graphStats.nodes} node / ${graphStats.edges} edge / ${graphStats.lessons} tanulság`,
      `Reflection engine: ${reflectionStats.totalReflections} reflexió, self-model health = ${reflectionStats.selfModelHealth}`,
